{"id":"khlop_ya","lemma":"хлопья","pos":"noun","rank":4026,"glosses":["flakes (soft, loose material composed of small, flattened individual pieces)","puffs, tufts, wisps (of clouds, smoke, etc.)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/01/Ru-%D1%85%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BF%D1%8C%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D1%85%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BF%D1%8C%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"хлопьев","plural":"хлопья"},"examples":[{"text":"Мне нужно немного молока для хлопьев.","en":"I need some milk for my cereal.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"it is necessary"},{"g":"a little, some"},{"g":"milk","l":"молоко"},{"g":"for"},null]},{"text":"На завтрак я ел хлопья.","en":"I ate cereal for breakfast.","words":[{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"breakfast"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"there is","l":"есть"},null]},{"text":"Том обычно ест на завтрак хлопья.","en":"Tom usually eats cereal for breakfast.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"usually"},{"g":"there is","l":"есть"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"breakfast"},null]},{"text":"Под диваном много хлопьев пыли.","en":"There are a lot of dustballs under the couch.","words":[{"g":"under, below, beneath"},null,{"g":"much"},null,{"g":"dust","l":"пыль"}]},{"text":"Том налил в хлопья молока.","en":"Tom poured milk on his cereal.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to pour","l":"налить"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"milk","l":"молоко"}]}]}